IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `dg-core`
IMPORT `dg9-seat`

-- Delaware General Corporation Law, 8 Del. C. ch. 1 -- piece dg9, LAYER 2: worked cases of the seat's questions.
-- One case at least for each question of dg9-seat.l4, in the facts a person in the seat would state; where the text can
-- answer "it does not say", a case asserts NOTHING. Every expected value is written by hand from the text, beside the
-- case, before the run; a failing assertion is a finding. Dates are made with the core's YMD (year month day).
-- A case is a person in the seat with a corporation: the comment above it names who and what happened.


-- s 271(a) the stockholders must vote on our sale, lease or exchange of assets
-- A stockholder: we are selling everything to an outside buyer; the vote is needed.
#ASSERT `s 271(a) the stockholders must vote on our sale, lease or exchange of assets` WITH `the sale, lease or exchange covers all or substantially all of the property and assets of the corporation, counting those of its subsidiaries` IS TRUE, `the transferee is wholly-owned by the corporation, directly or indirectly` IS FALSE, `the transferee is controlled by the corporation, directly or indirectly` IS FALSE, `our certificate of incorporation requires a resolution for a sale, lease or exchange to a subsidiary` IS FALSE
-- A director: the buyer is our wholly-owned, controlled subsidiary and the certificate is silent; no resolution is needed.
#ASSERT NOT (`s 271(a) the stockholders must vote on our sale, lease or exchange of assets` WITH `the sale, lease or exchange covers all or substantially all of the property and assets of the corporation, counting those of its subsidiaries` IS TRUE, `the transferee is wholly-owned by the corporation, directly or indirectly` IS TRUE, `the transferee is controlled by the corporation, directly or indirectly` IS TRUE, `our certificate of incorporation requires a resolution for a sale, lease or exchange to a subsidiary` IS FALSE)
-- The certificate of incorporation requires a resolution even for a subsidiary: the vote is needed.
#ASSERT `s 271(a) the stockholders must vote on our sale, lease or exchange of assets` WITH `the sale, lease or exchange covers all or substantially all of the property and assets of the corporation, counting those of its subsidiaries` IS TRUE, `the transferee is wholly-owned by the corporation, directly or indirectly` IS TRUE, `the transferee is controlled by the corporation, directly or indirectly` IS TRUE, `our certificate of incorporation requires a resolution for a sale, lease or exchange to a subsidiary` IS TRUE
-- Only a part of the assets, not substantially all: section 271(a) requires no resolution.
#ASSERT NOT (`s 271(a) the stockholders must vote on our sale, lease or exchange of assets` WITH `the sale, lease or exchange covers all or substantially all of the property and assets of the corporation, counting those of its subsidiaries` IS FALSE, `the transferee is wholly-owned by the corporation, directly or indirectly` IS FALSE, `the transferee is controlled by the corporation, directly or indirectly` IS FALSE, `our certificate of incorporation requires a resolution for a sale, lease or exchange to a subsidiary` IS FALSE)

-- s 271(a) our sale, lease or exchange of assets is validly authorized
-- A stockholder of a stock corporation: 51 of 100 votes, 20 days' notice, the notice said so.
#ASSERT (`s 271(a) our sale, lease or exchange of assets is validly authorized` WITH `our corporation is a nonstock corporation` IS FALSE, `the board of directors or governing body acted at a meeting and deems the terms and the consideration expedient and for the best interests of the corporation` IS TRUE, `the votes in favor of the resolution` IS 51, `the votes entitled to be cast on the resolution` IS 100, `the meeting was duly called` IS TRUE, `the date notice of the meeting was given` IS (YMD 2026 3 1), `the date of the meeting` IS (YMD 2026 3 21), `the notice stated that such a resolution will be considered` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- Exactly half is not a majority.
#ASSERT (`s 271(a) our sale, lease or exchange of assets is validly authorized` WITH `our corporation is a nonstock corporation` IS FALSE, `the board of directors or governing body acted at a meeting and deems the terms and the consideration expedient and for the best interests of the corporation` IS TRUE, `the votes in favor of the resolution` IS 50, `the votes entitled to be cast on the resolution` IS 100, `the meeting was duly called` IS TRUE, `the date notice of the meeting was given` IS (YMD 2026 3 1), `the date of the meeting` IS (YMD 2026 3 21), `the notice stated that such a resolution will be considered` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Only 19 days' notice.
#ASSERT (`s 271(a) our sale, lease or exchange of assets is validly authorized` WITH `our corporation is a nonstock corporation` IS FALSE, `the board of directors or governing body acted at a meeting and deems the terms and the consideration expedient and for the best interests of the corporation` IS TRUE, `the votes in favor of the resolution` IS 51, `the votes entitled to be cast on the resolution` IS 100, `the meeting was duly called` IS TRUE, `the date notice of the meeting was given` IS (YMD 2026 3 1), `the date of the meeting` IS (YMD 2026 3 20), `the notice stated that such a resolution will be considered` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- A nonstock corporation: 51 of 100 members, 21 days' notice.
#ASSERT (`s 271(a) our sale, lease or exchange of assets is validly authorized` WITH `our corporation is a nonstock corporation` IS TRUE, `the board of directors or governing body acted at a meeting and deems the terms and the consideration expedient and for the best interests of the corporation` IS TRUE, `the votes in favor of the resolution` IS 51, `the votes entitled to be cast on the resolution` IS 100, `the meeting was duly called` IS TRUE, `the date notice of the meeting was given` IS (YMD 2026 3 1), `the date of the meeting` IS (YMD 2026 3 22), `the notice stated that such a resolution will be considered` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- Not covered: more votes in favor than votes entitled cannot be a vote.
#ASSERT (`s 271(a) our sale, lease or exchange of assets is validly authorized` WITH `our corporation is a nonstock corporation` IS FALSE, `the board of directors or governing body acted at a meeting and deems the terms and the consideration expedient and for the best interests of the corporation` IS TRUE, `the votes in favor of the resolution` IS 101, `the votes entitled to be cast on the resolution` IS 100, `the meeting was duly called` IS TRUE, `the date notice of the meeting was given` IS (YMD 2026 3 1), `the date of the meeting` IS (YMD 2026 3 21), `the notice stated that such a resolution will be considered` IS TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING

-- s 271(b) the board may abandon the sale, lease or exchange that the stockholders approved
-- A director: the stockholders approved, and the board may still abandon the sale.
#ASSERT (`s 271(b) the board may abandon the sale, lease or exchange that the stockholders approved` WITH `the stockholders or members have authorized or consented to the proposed sale, lease or exchange` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- Not covered: the subsection speaks only of a proposal the stockholders authorized.
#ASSERT (`s 271(b) the board may abandon the sale, lease or exchange that the stockholders approved` WITH `the stockholders or members have authorized or consented to the proposed sale, lease or exchange` IS FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING

-- s 271(b) a third party's contract rights survive our abandoning the sale, lease or exchange
-- A buyer signed a contract with the corporation: abandoning is subject to the buyer's rights.
#ASSERT `s 271(b) a third party's contract rights survive our abandoning the sale, lease or exchange` WITH `a third party has rights under a contract relating to the proposed sale, lease or exchange` IS TRUE
-- No third party has contract rights: nothing survives.
#ASSERT NOT (`s 271(b) a third party's contract rights survive our abandoning the sale, lease or exchange` WITH `a third party has rights under a contract relating to the proposed sale, lease or exchange` IS FALSE)

-- s 271(c) the value of our property and assets, counting our subsidiaries'
-- A director adds the corporation's 1,000 to its subsidiaries' 500.
#ASSERT (`s 271(c) the value of our property and assets, counting our subsidiaries'` WITH `the value of the property and assets of the corporation itself` IS 1000, `the value of the property and assets of all the subsidiaries of the corporation together` IS 500) EQUALS 1500

-- s 272(a) the stockholders must consent to a mortgage or pledge of our assets
-- An officer: the certificate is silent, so no stockholder consent is necessary.
#ASSERT NOT (`s 272(a) the stockholders must consent to a mortgage or pledge of our assets` WITH `our certificate of incorporation requires the authorization or consent of stockholders to a mortgage or pledge` IS FALSE)
-- The certificate requires it: consent is necessary.
#ASSERT `s 272(a) the stockholders must consent to a mortgage or pledge of our assets` WITH `our certificate of incorporation requires the authorization or consent of stockholders to a mortgage or pledge` IS TRUE

-- s 272(b) the stockholders need not vote on the sale of our collateral
-- A stockholder: the secured party is foreclosing on the collateral without the corporation's consent.
#ASSERT `s 272(b) the stockholders need not vote on the sale of our collateral` WITH `the property or assets are collateral that secures a mortgage or are pledged to a secured party` IS TRUE, `the secured party exercises its rights under the law governing the mortgage or pledge to effect the sale, lease or exchange without the consent of the corporation` IS TRUE, `the board of directors authorizes an alternative sale, lease or exchange, whether with the secured party or with another person` IS FALSE, `the alternative sale, lease or exchange results in the reduction or elimination of the total liabilities or obligations secured by the property or assets` IS FALSE, `the value of the property or assets` IS 0, `the total amount of the liabilities or obligations being eliminated or reduced` IS 0, `the sale, lease or exchange is prohibited by the law governing the mortgage or pledge` IS FALSE
-- The board's alternative sale: value 100 against debt 100 qualifies (less than or equal).
#ASSERT `s 272(b) the stockholders need not vote on the sale of our collateral` WITH `the property or assets are collateral that secures a mortgage or are pledged to a secured party` IS TRUE, `the secured party exercises its rights under the law governing the mortgage or pledge to effect the sale, lease or exchange without the consent of the corporation` IS FALSE, `the board of directors authorizes an alternative sale, lease or exchange, whether with the secured party or with another person` IS TRUE, `the alternative sale, lease or exchange results in the reduction or elimination of the total liabilities or obligations secured by the property or assets` IS TRUE, `the value of the property or assets` IS 100, `the total amount of the liabilities or obligations being eliminated or reduced` IS 100, `the sale, lease or exchange is prohibited by the law governing the mortgage or pledge` IS FALSE
-- Value 101 against debt 100: the proviso fails, the vote is still needed.
#ASSERT NOT (`s 272(b) the stockholders need not vote on the sale of our collateral` WITH `the property or assets are collateral that secures a mortgage or are pledged to a secured party` IS TRUE, `the secured party exercises its rights under the law governing the mortgage or pledge to effect the sale, lease or exchange without the consent of the corporation` IS FALSE, `the board of directors authorizes an alternative sale, lease or exchange, whether with the secured party or with another person` IS TRUE, `the alternative sale, lease or exchange results in the reduction or elimination of the total liabilities or obligations secured by the property or assets` IS TRUE, `the value of the property or assets` IS 101, `the total amount of the liabilities or obligations being eliminated or reduced` IS 100, `the sale, lease or exchange is prohibited by the law governing the mortgage or pledge` IS FALSE)
-- Not collateral at all: the exception does not apply.
#ASSERT NOT (`s 272(b) the stockholders need not vote on the sale of our collateral` WITH `the property or assets are collateral that secures a mortgage or are pledged to a secured party` IS FALSE, `the secured party exercises its rights under the law governing the mortgage or pledge to effect the sale, lease or exchange without the consent of the corporation` IS TRUE, `the board of directors authorizes an alternative sale, lease or exchange, whether with the secured party or with another person` IS TRUE, `the alternative sale, lease or exchange results in the reduction or elimination of the total liabilities or obligations secured by the property or assets` IS TRUE, `the value of the property or assets` IS 100, `the total amount of the liabilities or obligations being eliminated or reduced` IS 100, `the sale, lease or exchange is prohibited by the law governing the mortgage or pledge` IS FALSE)

-- s 272(c) the transferee's purchase stands although the value test failed
-- A transferee who paid and acted in good faith is protected after the fact.
#ASSERT `s 272(c) the transferee's purchase stands although the value test failed` WITH `the transferee provided value for the property or assets, which may include the reduction or elimination of the liabilities or obligations secured by them` IS TRUE, `the transferee acted in good faith as defined in § 1-201(b) of Title 6` IS TRUE, `the proceeding is one against the corporation and any other necessary parties to enjoin the sale, lease or exchange before its consummation` IS FALSE
-- A stockholder suing to enjoin the sale before closing: the protection does not apply.
#ASSERT NOT (`s 272(c) the transferee's purchase stands although the value test failed` WITH `the transferee provided value for the property or assets, which may include the reduction or elimination of the liabilities or obligations secured by them` IS TRUE, `the transferee acted in good faith as defined in § 1-201(b) of Title 6` IS TRUE, `the proceeding is one against the corporation and any other necessary parties to enjoin the sale, lease or exchange before its consummation` IS TRUE)
-- No value given: no protection.
#ASSERT NOT (`s 272(c) the transferee's purchase stands although the value test failed` WITH `the transferee provided value for the property or assets, which may include the reduction or elimination of the liabilities or obligations secured by them` IS FALSE, `the transferee acted in good faith as defined in § 1-201(b) of Title 6` IS TRUE, `the proceeding is one against the corporation and any other necessary parties to enjoin the sale, lease or exchange before its consummation` IS FALSE)

-- s 272(c) I can still be made to pay damages for a breach of fiduciary duty about the sale
-- A director: the protection of the transferee does not eliminate a fiduciary-duty claim.
#ASSERT (`s 272(c) I can still be made to pay damages for a breach of fiduciary duty about the sale` WITH `the claim is based upon a violation of fiduciary duty by a current or former director or officer or stockholder` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- Any other claim: the sentence does not speak.
#ASSERT (`s 272(c) I can still be made to pay damages for a breach of fiduciary duty about the sale` WITH `the claim is based upon a violation of fiduciary duty by a current or former director or officer or stockholder` IS FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING

-- s 272(d) our certificate's consent requirement applies to a collateral sale
-- A provision adopted in 2024 that does not say so does not apply to the collateral sale.
#ASSERT (`s 272(d) our certificate's consent requirement applies to a collateral sale` WITH `the date the certificate provision first became effective` IS (YMD 2024 1 1), `the certificate provision expressly requires its application to a transaction permitted by s 272(b)` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- The same provision, expressly saying so, applies.
#ASSERT (`s 272(d) our certificate's consent requirement applies to a collateral sale` WITH `the date the certificate provision first became effective` IS (YMD 2024 1 1), `the certificate provision expressly requires its application to a transaction permitted by s 272(b)` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- Adopted a day before 1 August 2023: not covered by the subsection.
#ASSERT (`s 272(d) our certificate's consent requirement applies to a collateral sale` WITH `the date the certificate provision first became effective` IS (YMD 2023 7 31), `the certificate provision expressly requires its application to a transaction permitted by s 272(b)` IS FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING

-- s 273(a) I may petition the Court of Chancery to wind up our two-stockholder joint venture
-- A 50% stockholder: two stockholders, a joint venture, deadlocked, nothing in the certificate or a written agreement.
#ASSERT `s 273(a) I may petition the Court of Chancery to wind up our two-stockholder joint venture` WITH `the corporation is a corporation of this State` IS TRUE, `the number of stockholders` IS 2, `the proportion of the stock owned by the petitioner` IS 0.5, `the proportion of the stock owned by the other stockholder` IS 0.5, `the stockholders are engaged in the prosecution of a joint venture` IS TRUE, `the stockholders are unable to agree upon the desirability of discontinuing the joint venture and disposing of the assets used in it` IS TRUE, `the certificate of incorporation provides otherwise` IS FALSE, `a written agreement between the stockholders provides otherwise` IS FALSE
-- A 60% stockholder: each must own 50%.
#ASSERT NOT (`s 273(a) I may petition the Court of Chancery to wind up our two-stockholder joint venture` WITH `the corporation is a corporation of this State` IS TRUE, `the number of stockholders` IS 2, `the proportion of the stock owned by the petitioner` IS 0.6, `the proportion of the stock owned by the other stockholder` IS 0.4, `the stockholders are engaged in the prosecution of a joint venture` IS TRUE, `the stockholders are unable to agree upon the desirability of discontinuing the joint venture and disposing of the assets used in it` IS TRUE, `the certificate of incorporation provides otherwise` IS FALSE, `a written agreement between the stockholders provides otherwise` IS FALSE)
-- Three stockholders: not 'only 2'.
#ASSERT NOT (`s 273(a) I may petition the Court of Chancery to wind up our two-stockholder joint venture` WITH `the corporation is a corporation of this State` IS TRUE, `the number of stockholders` IS 3, `the proportion of the stock owned by the petitioner` IS 0.5, `the proportion of the stock owned by the other stockholder` IS 0.5, `the stockholders are engaged in the prosecution of a joint venture` IS TRUE, `the stockholders are unable to agree upon the desirability of discontinuing the joint venture and disposing of the assets used in it` IS TRUE, `the certificate of incorporation provides otherwise` IS FALSE, `a written agreement between the stockholders provides otherwise` IS FALSE)
-- A written agreement between the stockholders provides otherwise.
#ASSERT NOT (`s 273(a) I may petition the Court of Chancery to wind up our two-stockholder joint venture` WITH `the corporation is a corporation of this State` IS TRUE, `the number of stockholders` IS 2, `the proportion of the stock owned by the petitioner` IS 0.5, `the proportion of the stock owned by the other stockholder` IS 0.5, `the stockholders are engaged in the prosecution of a joint venture` IS TRUE, `the stockholders are unable to agree upon the desirability of discontinuing the joint venture and disposing of the assets used in it` IS TRUE, `the certificate of incorporation provides otherwise` IS FALSE, `a written agreement between the stockholders provides otherwise` IS TRUE)

-- s 273(a) my petition for the joint venture is in order
-- Everything attached and executed.
#ASSERT `s 273(a) my petition for the joint venture is in order` WITH `the petition states that the stockholder desires to discontinue the joint venture and dispose of its assets in accordance with a plan to be agreed upon by both stockholders or, if no plan is agreed, that the corporation be dissolved` IS TRUE, `a copy of the proposed plan of discontinuance and distribution is attached` IS TRUE, `a certificate is attached stating that copies of the petition and plan have been transmitted in writing to the other stockholder and to the directors and officers` IS TRUE, `the petition and the certificate were executed and acknowledged in accordance with § 103` IS TRUE
-- The plan is not attached.
#ASSERT NOT (`s 273(a) my petition for the joint venture is in order` WITH `the petition states that the stockholder desires to discontinue the joint venture and dispose of its assets in accordance with a plan to be agreed upon by both stockholders or, if no plan is agreed, that the corporation be dissolved` IS TRUE, `a copy of the proposed plan of discontinuance and distribution is attached` IS FALSE, `a certificate is attached stating that copies of the petition and plan have been transmitted in writing to the other stockholder and to the directors and officers` IS TRUE, `the petition and the certificate were executed and acknowledged in accordance with § 103` IS TRUE)

-- s 273(b) the Court of Chancery can now dissolve our joint-venture corporation
-- A stockholder, three months and a day after the petition: no certificate of agreement was filed.
#ASSERT `s 273(b) the Court of Chancery can now dissolve our joint-venture corporation` WITH `the date the petition was filed with the Court of Chancery` IS (YMD 2026 1 15), `the date of the question` IS (YMD 2026 4 16), `both stockholders filed the certificate that they have agreed on the plan` IS FALSE, `the date both stockholders filed the certificate that they have agreed on the plan` IS (YMD 2026 1 1), `both stockholders filed the certificate that the distribution is completed` IS FALSE, `the date both stockholders filed the certificate that the distribution is completed` IS (YMD 2026 1 1), `we extended the 3-month period by a certificate filed with the Court` IS FALSE, `the date to which we extended the 3-month period` IS (YMD 2026 1 1), `the date we filed the certificate extending the 3-month period` IS (YMD 2026 1 1), `we extended the 1-year period by a certificate filed with the Court` IS FALSE, `the date to which we extended the 1-year period` IS (YMD 2026 1 1), `the date we filed the certificate extending the 1-year period` IS (YMD 2026 1 1)
-- On the last day of the 3 months the period has not yet failed.
#ASSERT NOT (`s 273(b) the Court of Chancery can now dissolve our joint-venture corporation` WITH `the date the petition was filed with the Court of Chancery` IS (YMD 2026 1 15), `the date of the question` IS (YMD 2026 4 15), `both stockholders filed the certificate that they have agreed on the plan` IS FALSE, `the date both stockholders filed the certificate that they have agreed on the plan` IS (YMD 2026 1 1), `both stockholders filed the certificate that the distribution is completed` IS FALSE, `the date both stockholders filed the certificate that the distribution is completed` IS (YMD 2026 1 1), `we extended the 3-month period by a certificate filed with the Court` IS FALSE, `the date to which we extended the 3-month period` IS (YMD 2026 1 1), `the date we filed the certificate extending the 3-month period` IS (YMD 2026 1 1), `we extended the 1-year period by a certificate filed with the Court` IS FALSE, `the date to which we extended the 1-year period` IS (YMD 2026 1 1), `the date we filed the certificate extending the 1-year period` IS (YMD 2026 1 1))
-- The plan was agreed in time but the distribution was not certified complete within the year.
#ASSERT `s 273(b) the Court of Chancery can now dissolve our joint-venture corporation` WITH `the date the petition was filed with the Court of Chancery` IS (YMD 2026 1 15), `the date of the question` IS (YMD 2027 1 16), `both stockholders filed the certificate that they have agreed on the plan` IS TRUE, `the date both stockholders filed the certificate that they have agreed on the plan` IS (YMD 2026 3 1), `both stockholders filed the certificate that the distribution is completed` IS FALSE, `the date both stockholders filed the certificate that the distribution is completed` IS (YMD 2026 1 1), `we extended the 3-month period by a certificate filed with the Court` IS FALSE, `the date to which we extended the 3-month period` IS (YMD 2026 1 1), `the date we filed the certificate extending the 3-month period` IS (YMD 2026 1 1), `we extended the 1-year period by a certificate filed with the Court` IS FALSE, `the date to which we extended the 1-year period` IS (YMD 2026 1 1), `the date we filed the certificate extending the 1-year period` IS (YMD 2026 1 1)
-- We extended the 3 months to 15 July 2026 by a certificate filed on the last day: not yet failed.
#ASSERT NOT (`s 273(b) the Court of Chancery can now dissolve our joint-venture corporation` WITH `the date the petition was filed with the Court of Chancery` IS (YMD 2026 1 15), `the date of the question` IS (YMD 2026 5 1), `both stockholders filed the certificate that they have agreed on the plan` IS FALSE, `the date both stockholders filed the certificate that they have agreed on the plan` IS (YMD 2026 1 1), `both stockholders filed the certificate that the distribution is completed` IS FALSE, `the date both stockholders filed the certificate that the distribution is completed` IS (YMD 2026 1 1), `we extended the 3-month period by a certificate filed with the Court` IS TRUE, `the date to which we extended the 3-month period` IS (YMD 2026 7 15), `the date we filed the certificate extending the 3-month period` IS (YMD 2026 4 15), `we extended the 1-year period by a certificate filed with the Court` IS FALSE, `the date to which we extended the 1-year period` IS (YMD 2026 1 1), `the date we filed the certificate extending the 1-year period` IS (YMD 2026 1 1))
-- Both certificates were filed in time.
#ASSERT NOT (`s 273(b) the Court of Chancery can now dissolve our joint-venture corporation` WITH `the date the petition was filed with the Court of Chancery` IS (YMD 2026 1 15), `the date of the question` IS (YMD 2027 6 1), `both stockholders filed the certificate that they have agreed on the plan` IS TRUE, `the date both stockholders filed the certificate that they have agreed on the plan` IS (YMD 2026 3 1), `both stockholders filed the certificate that the distribution is completed` IS TRUE, `the date both stockholders filed the certificate that the distribution is completed` IS (YMD 2026 12 1), `we extended the 3-month period by a certificate filed with the Court` IS FALSE, `the date to which we extended the 3-month period` IS (YMD 2026 1 1), `the date we filed the certificate extending the 3-month period` IS (YMD 2026 1 1), `we extended the 1-year period by a certificate filed with the Court` IS FALSE, `the date to which we extended the 1-year period` IS (YMD 2026 1 1), `the date we filed the certificate extending the 1-year period` IS (YMD 2026 1 1))

-- s 273(c) I have given the Attorney General the copy of my petition in time
-- Charitable corporation: the copy went in on the 8th day, within 1 week.
#ASSERT `s 273(c) I have given the Attorney General the copy of my petition in time` WITH `the kind of corporation` IS `a charitable nonstock corporation`, `the date the petition was filed with the Court of Chancery` IS (YMD 2026 5 1), `I gave the Attorney General a copy of the petition` IS TRUE, `the date I gave the Attorney General a copy of the petition` IS (YMD 2026 5 8)
-- A day late.
#ASSERT NOT (`s 273(c) I have given the Attorney General the copy of my petition in time` WITH `the kind of corporation` IS `a charitable nonstock corporation`, `the date the petition was filed with the Court of Chancery` IS (YMD 2026 5 1), `I gave the Attorney General a copy of the petition` IS TRUE, `the date I gave the Attorney General a copy of the petition` IS (YMD 2026 5 9))
-- A stock corporation: no such duty.
#ASSERT `s 273(c) I have given the Attorney General the copy of my petition in time` WITH `the kind of corporation` IS `a stock corporation`, `the date the petition was filed with the Court of Chancery` IS (YMD 2026 5 1), `I gave the Attorney General a copy of the petition` IS FALSE, `the date I gave the Attorney General a copy of the petition` IS (YMD 2026 5 1)

-- s 274 as an incorporator or director I may surrender the charter before shares are issued or business begins
-- A director: no shares issued, no business; 3 of 5 directors sign.
#ASSERT (`s 274 as an incorporator or director I may surrender the charter before shares are issued or business begins` WITH `the corporation has issued shares` IS FALSE, `the corporation has commenced the business for which it was organized` IS FALSE, `directors were named in the certificate of incorporation or have been elected` IS TRUE, `the number of incorporators` IS 3, `the number of directors` IS 5, `the number of those who execute and acknowledge the certificate` IS 3) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- An incorporator: no directors yet; 2 of 3 incorporators sign.
#ASSERT (`s 274 as an incorporator or director I may surrender the charter before shares are issued or business begins` WITH `the corporation has issued shares` IS FALSE, `the corporation has commenced the business for which it was organized` IS FALSE, `directors were named in the certificate of incorporation or have been elected` IS FALSE, `the number of incorporators` IS 3, `the number of directors` IS 0, `the number of those who execute and acknowledge the certificate` IS 2) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- 2 of 4 directors is only half, not a majority.
#ASSERT (`s 274 as an incorporator or director I may surrender the charter before shares are issued or business begins` WITH `the corporation has issued shares` IS FALSE, `the corporation has commenced the business for which it was organized` IS FALSE, `directors were named in the certificate of incorporation or have been elected` IS TRUE, `the number of incorporators` IS 3, `the number of directors` IS 4, `the number of those who execute and acknowledge the certificate` IS 2) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Shares were issued and business begun: the section does not apply.
#ASSERT (`s 274 as an incorporator or director I may surrender the charter before shares are issued or business begins` WITH `the corporation has issued shares` IS TRUE, `the corporation has commenced the business for which it was organized` IS TRUE, `directors were named in the certificate of incorporation or have been elected` IS TRUE, `the number of incorporators` IS 3, `the number of directors` IS 5, `the number of those who execute and acknowledge the certificate` IS 3) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Not covered: more signatories than directors.
#ASSERT (`s 274 as an incorporator or director I may surrender the charter before shares are issued or business begins` WITH `the corporation has issued shares` IS FALSE, `the corporation has commenced the business for which it was organized` IS FALSE, `directors were named in the certificate of incorporation or have been elected` IS TRUE, `the number of incorporators` IS 3, `the number of directors` IS 5, `the number of those who execute and acknowledge the certificate` IS 6) EQUALS NOTHING

-- s 274 our certificate of surrender says what the section requires
-- An incorporator: no business begun, no shares, no stock certificates; the debts and certificates statements are not needed.
#ASSERT `s 274 our certificate of surrender says what the section requires` WITH `statement that no shares have been issued or that the business has not been begun` IS TRUE, `statement of the date of filing of the original certificate of incorporation` IS TRUE, `statement that no part of the capital has been paid or that the amount paid in, less necessary expenses, has been returned` IS TRUE, `statement that all debts of the corporation have been paid` IS FALSE, `statement that all issued stock certificates have been surrendered and cancelled` IS FALSE, `statement that all rights and franchises of the corporation are surrendered` IS TRUE, `the corporation has begun business but has not issued shares` IS FALSE, `the corporation has not begun business but has issued stock certificates` IS FALSE
-- Business was begun without shares: the statement that all debts are paid is required and missing.
#ASSERT NOT (`s 274 our certificate of surrender says what the section requires` WITH `statement that no shares have been issued or that the business has not been begun` IS TRUE, `statement of the date of filing of the original certificate of incorporation` IS TRUE, `statement that no part of the capital has been paid or that the amount paid in, less necessary expenses, has been returned` IS TRUE, `statement that all debts of the corporation have been paid` IS FALSE, `statement that all issued stock certificates have been surrendered and cancelled` IS FALSE, `statement that all rights and franchises of the corporation are surrendered` IS TRUE, `the corporation has begun business but has not issued shares` IS TRUE, `the corporation has not begun business but has issued stock certificates` IS FALSE)
-- The surrender of rights and franchises is not stated.
#ASSERT NOT (`s 274 our certificate of surrender says what the section requires` WITH `statement that no shares have been issued or that the business has not been begun` IS TRUE, `statement of the date of filing of the original certificate of incorporation` IS TRUE, `statement that no part of the capital has been paid or that the amount paid in, less necessary expenses, has been returned` IS TRUE, `statement that all debts of the corporation have been paid` IS TRUE, `statement that all issued stock certificates have been surrendered and cancelled` IS FALSE, `statement that all rights and franchises of the corporation are surrendered` IS FALSE, `the corporation has begun business but has not issued shares` IS FALSE, `the corporation has not begun business but has issued stock certificates` IS FALSE)

-- s 274 our corporation is dissolved when the certificate of surrender takes effect
-- An incorporator: once the certificate is effective the corporation is dissolved.
