-- Only 9 of 10 consented, and 50 of 100 votes is not a majority.
#ASSERT (`s 275(a) to (c) the dissolution of our corporation is authorized` WITH `the number of directors who voted for the resolution` IS 5, `the number of directors constituting the whole board` IS 9, `the meeting of the board was called for the purpose of the resolution` IS TRUE, `notice of the adoption of the resolution and of the meeting of stockholders was given to each stockholder entitled to vote as of the record date` IS TRUE, `the votes for the proposed dissolution` IS 50, `the votes of the outstanding stock entitled to vote thereon` IS 100, `the number of stockholders entitled to vote who consented in writing` IS 9, `the number of stockholders entitled to vote` IS 10) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Not covered: more directors voted than there are on the board.
