-- It did not.
#ASSERT NOT (`s 294 the trustees or receivers must report to the Court on their proceedings` WITH `the Court of Chancery has directed a report on this occasion` IS FALSE)

-- s 295 I made and filed proof of my claim as the section requires
-- A creditor filed on the last day fixed.
#ASSERT `s 295 I made and filed proof of my claim as the section requires` WITH `the creditor made proof of the claim under oath` IS TRUE, `the creditor caused the proof to be filed in the office of the Register in Chancery of the county in which the proceeding is pending` IS TRUE, `the proof was filed` IS TRUE, `the date the proof was filed` IS (YMD 2026 9 30), `the last day fixed for filing proofs of claim by the rules of the Court of Chancery or the order of the Court` IS (YMD 2026 9 30)
