-- 9000 due, capped at 2 months: 6000.
#ASSERT (`s 300 the amount of my lien for wages` WITH `the person has a lien under section 300` IS TRUE, `the wages due to the person` IS 9000, `the person's wages for one month` IS 3000) EQUALS 6000
-- No lien.
