-- s 302(a) I am bound by the creditors' compromise provision in the certificate of incorporation
-- In the original certificate: binding on everyone who becomes a creditor or stockholder.
#ASSERT (`s 302(a) I am bound by the creditors' compromise provision in the certificate of incorporation` WITH `the provision permitted by § 102(b)(2) is included in the original certificate of incorporation` IS TRUE, `the provision was inserted in the certificate of incorporation by an amendment` IS FALSE, `the date the provision was inserted in the certificate of incorporation by an amendment` IS (YMD 2020 1 1), `the date the person became a creditor or stockholder` IS (YMD 2026 1 1)) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- Inserted by amendment in 2020; I became a stockholder in 2026.
#ASSERT (`s 302(a) I am bound by the creditors' compromise provision in the certificate of incorporation` WITH `the provision permitted by § 102(b)(2) is included in the original certificate of incorporation` IS FALSE, `the provision was inserted in the certificate of incorporation by an amendment` IS TRUE, `the date the provision was inserted in the certificate of incorporation by an amendment` IS (YMD 2020 1 1), `the date the person became a creditor or stockholder` IS (YMD 2026 1 1)) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- I became a stockholder before the amendment: the text does not say I am bound.
#ASSERT (`s 302(a) I am bound by the creditors' compromise provision in the certificate of incorporation` WITH `the provision permitted by § 102(b)(2) is included in the original certificate of incorporation` IS FALSE, `the provision was inserted in the certificate of incorporation by an amendment` IS TRUE, `the date the provision was inserted in the certificate of incorporation by an amendment` IS (YMD 2020 1 1), `the date the person became a creditor or stockholder` IS (YMD 2019 1 1)) EQUALS NOTHING
-- The provision was never inserted.
#ASSERT (`s 302(a) I am bound by the creditors' compromise provision in the certificate of incorporation` WITH `the provision permitted by § 102(b)(2) is included in the original certificate of incorporation` IS FALSE, `the provision was inserted in the certificate of incorporation by an amendment` IS FALSE, `the date the provision was inserted in the certificate of incorporation by an amendment` IS (YMD 2020 1 1), `the date the person became a creditor or stockholder` IS (YMD 2026 1 1)) EQUALS NOTHING

-- s 302(b) the Court of Chancery has this power over a corporation with a compromise provision
-- A compromise was made.
#ASSERT `s 302(b) the Court of Chancery has this power over a corporation with a compromise provision` WITH `the power` IS `to administer and enforce a compromise or arrangement made pursuant to the provision`, `a compromise or arrangement was made pursuant to the provision contained in § 102(b)(2)` IS TRUE, `the Court of Chancery has begun the administration and enforcement of that provision with respect to the corporation` IS FALSE
-- The Court has begun to administer and enforce the provision: it may restrain suits against the corporation.
#ASSERT `s 302(b) the Court of Chancery has this power over a corporation with a compromise provision` WITH `the power` IS `to restrain, pendente lite, all actions and proceedings against the corporation`, `a compromise or arrangement was made pursuant to the provision contained in § 102(b)(2)` IS FALSE, `the Court of Chancery has begun the administration and enforcement of that provision with respect to the corporation` IS TRUE
-- A compromise was made but the Court has not begun to administer the provision.
#ASSERT NOT (`s 302(b) the Court of Chancery has this power over a corporation with a compromise provision` WITH `the power` IS `to restrain, pendente lite, all actions and proceedings against the corporation`, `a compromise or arrangement was made pursuant to the provision contained in § 102(b)(2)` IS TRUE, `the Court of Chancery has begun the administration and enforcement of that provision with respect to the corporation` IS FALSE)

-- s 303(a) our corporation in bankruptcy may take the corporate action without its directors or stockholders
-- A stockholder: the bankruptcy order directs it and the case is open.
#ASSERT `s 303(a) our corporation in bankruptcy may take the corporate action without its directors or stockholders` WITH `the corporation is a corporation of this State` IS TRUE, `an order for relief with respect to the corporation has been entered pursuant to the Federal Bankruptcy Code` IS TRUE, `the corporate action is provided or directed by a decree or order of the court or judge in the bankruptcy proceeding` IS TRUE, `a final decree in the bankruptcy proceeding has been entered closing the case and discharging the trustee or trustees, if any` IS FALSE
-- The final decree has been entered.
#ASSERT NOT (`s 303(a) our corporation in bankruptcy may take the corporate action without its directors or stockholders` WITH `the corporation is a corporation of this State` IS TRUE, `an order for relief with respect to the corporation has been entered pursuant to the Federal Bankruptcy Code` IS TRUE, `the corporate action is provided or directed by a decree or order of the court or judge in the bankruptcy proceeding` IS TRUE, `a final decree in the bankruptcy proceeding has been entered closing the case and discharging the trustee or trustees, if any` IS TRUE)
-- No order for relief.
#ASSERT NOT (`s 303(a) our corporation in bankruptcy may take the corporate action without its directors or stockholders` WITH `the corporation is a corporation of this State` IS TRUE, `an order for relief with respect to the corporation has been entered pursuant to the Federal Bankruptcy Code` IS FALSE, `the corporate action is provided or directed by a decree or order of the court or judge in the bankruptcy proceeding` IS TRUE, `a final decree in the bankruptcy proceeding has been entered closing the case and discharging the trustee or trustees, if any` IS FALSE)

-- s 303(a) this person may exercise our corporation's power in bankruptcy
-- Trustees are acting: a majority of them.
#ASSERT `s 303(a) this person may exercise our corporation's power in bankruptcy` WITH `the person` IS `a majority of the trustees appointed or elected in the bankruptcy proceeding`, `trustees have been appointed or elected in the bankruptcy proceeding and are acting` IS TRUE
-- Trustees are acting, so the officers do not.
#ASSERT NOT (`s 303(a) this person may exercise our corporation's power in bankruptcy` WITH `the person` IS `the designated officers of the corporation`, `trustees have been appointed or elected in the bankruptcy proceeding and are acting` IS TRUE)
-- None acting: the designated officers.
#ASSERT `s 303(a) this person may exercise our corporation's power in bankruptcy` WITH `the person` IS `the designated officers of the corporation`, `trustees have been appointed or elected in the bankruptcy proceeding and are acting` IS FALSE

-- s 303(b) our corporation in bankruptcy may take this corporate action in the manner of subsection (a)
-- A director: dissolve, directed by the bankruptcy order.
#ASSERT `s 303(b) our corporation in bankruptcy may take this corporate action in the manner of subsection (a)` WITH `the corporate action` IS `be dissolved`, `the corporation may take corporate action in the manner provided in subsection (a)` IS TRUE, `the lease is permitted by law` IS FALSE
-- A lease only if permitted by law.
#ASSERT NOT (`s 303(b) our corporation in bankruptcy may take this corporate action in the manner of subsection (a)` WITH `the corporate action` IS `lease its property and franchises to any corporation`, `the corporation may take corporate action in the manner provided in subsection (a)` IS TRUE, `the lease is permitted by law` IS FALSE)
-- A lease permitted by law.
#ASSERT `s 303(b) our corporation in bankruptcy may take this corporate action in the manner of subsection (a)` WITH `the corporate action` IS `lease its property and franchises to any corporation`, `the corporation may take corporate action in the manner provided in subsection (a)` IS TRUE, `the lease is permitted by law` IS TRUE
-- Subsection (a) does not allow it.
#ASSERT NOT (`s 303(b) our corporation in bankruptcy may take this corporate action in the manner of subsection (a)` WITH `the corporate action` IS `transfer all or part of its assets`, `the corporation may take corporate action in the manner provided in subsection (a)` IS FALSE, `the lease is permitted by law` IS FALSE)

-- s 303(b) I have a right of appraisal when the corporation in bankruptcy merges
-- A minority stockholder in a merger ordered by the bankruptcy court: no statutory right of appraisal.
#ASSERT (`s 303(b) I have a right of appraisal when the corporation in bankruptcy merges` WITH `the corporate action` IS `merge or consolidate as permitted by this chapter`) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- For any other action this section does not say.
#ASSERT (`s 303(b) I have a right of appraisal when the corporation in bankruptcy merges` WITH `the corporate action` IS `be dissolved`) EQUALS NOTHING

-- s 303(c) our certificate, agreement or other instrument made in bankruptcy is in order
