-- A majority, but notice of the special meeting was not given.
#ASSERT (`s 311(a) our revocation of the dissolution or the restoration of the certificate is authorized` WITH `the event` IS `a dissolution pursuant to section 275`, `the board of directors adopted a resolution recommending the revocation or restoration and directing that the question be submitted to a vote at a special meeting of stockholders` IS TRUE, `notice of the special meeting was given to each of the stockholders in accordance with § 222` IS FALSE, `the votes voted for the resolution` IS 51, `the votes of the stock outstanding and entitled to vote at the time of the dissolution or the expiration` IS 100, `the stockholders have given their written consent in lieu of a meeting and vote, in accordance with § 228` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Restoring an expired certificate, a majority of the stock entitled to vote on an amendment to the duration.
#ASSERT (`s 311(a) our revocation of the dissolution or the restoration of the certificate is authorized` WITH `the event` IS `an expiration of the time limited for the corporation’s existence`, `the board of directors adopted a resolution recommending the revocation or restoration and directing that the question be submitted to a vote at a special meeting of stockholders` IS TRUE, `notice of the special meeting was given to each of the stockholders in accordance with § 222` IS TRUE, `the votes voted for the resolution` IS 60, `the votes of the stock outstanding and entitled to vote at the time of the dissolution or the expiration` IS 100, `the stockholders have given their written consent in lieu of a meeting and vote, in accordance with § 228` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- The board adopted no resolution.
#ASSERT (`s 311(a) our revocation of the dissolution or the restoration of the certificate is authorized` WITH `the event` IS `a dissolution pursuant to section 275`, `the board of directors adopted a resolution recommending the revocation or restoration and directing that the question be submitted to a vote at a special meeting of stockholders` IS FALSE, `notice of the special meeting was given to each of the stockholders in accordance with § 222` IS TRUE, `the votes voted for the resolution` IS 100, `the votes of the stock outstanding and entitled to vote at the time of the dissolution or the expiration` IS 100, `the stockholders have given their written consent in lieu of a meeting and vote, in accordance with § 228` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- In lieu of a meeting and vote, the stockholders consented in writing.
