-- s 312(h) the revival is authorized by the board
-- A director: 2 of the 3 in office, though a quorum may be more.
#ASSERT (`s 312(h) the revival is authorized by the board` WITH `the number of directors or members of the governing body then in office` IS 3, `the number of them who authorize the revival and the filing of the certificate` IS 2, `the stockholders elected a full board of directors as provided by the bylaws` IS FALSE, `the board so elected authorized the revival and the filing of the certificate` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- 2 of 4 is not a majority.
#ASSERT (`s 312(h) the revival is authorized by the board` WITH `the number of directors or members of the governing body then in office` IS 4, `the number of them who authorize the revival and the filing of the certificate` IS 2, `the stockholders elected a full board of directors as provided by the bylaws` IS FALSE, `the board so elected authorized the revival and the filing of the certificate` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- The sole director in office.
#ASSERT (`s 312(h) the revival is authorized by the board` WITH `the number of directors or members of the governing body then in office` IS 1, `the number of them who authorize the revival and the filing of the certificate` IS 1, `the stockholders elected a full board of directors as provided by the bylaws` IS FALSE, `the board so elected authorized the revival and the filing of the certificate` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- No directors: the stockholders elected a full board, which authorized the revival.
#ASSERT (`s 312(h) the revival is authorized by the board` WITH `the number of directors or members of the governing body then in office` IS 0, `the number of them who authorize the revival and the filing of the certificate` IS 0, `the stockholders elected a full board of directors as provided by the bylaws` IS TRUE, `the board so elected authorized the revival and the filing of the certificate` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- The elected board did not authorize it.
#ASSERT (`s 312(h) the revival is authorized by the board` WITH `the number of directors or members of the governing body then in office` IS 0, `the number of them who authorize the revival and the filing of the certificate` IS 0, `the stockholders elected a full board of directors as provided by the bylaws` IS TRUE, `the board so elected authorized the revival and the filing of the certificate` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Not covered: more authorizing than are in office.
#ASSERT (`s 312(h) the revival is authorized by the board` WITH `the number of directors or members of the governing body then in office` IS 3, `the number of them who authorize the revival and the filing of the certificate` IS 4, `the stockholders elected a full board of directors as provided by the bylaws` IS FALSE, `the board so elected authorized the revival and the filing of the certificate` IS FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING

-- s 312(h) I may call the special meeting of stockholders to elect directors
-- An officer, on notice under section 222.
#ASSERT `s 312(h) I may call the special meeting of stockholders to elect directors` WITH `I am an officer of the corporation` IS TRUE, `I am a stockholder of the corporation` IS FALSE, `notice is given in accordance with § 222` IS TRUE
-- A stockholder.
#ASSERT `s 312(h) I may call the special meeting of stockholders to elect directors` WITH `I am an officer of the corporation` IS FALSE, `I am a stockholder of the corporation` IS TRUE, `notice is given in accordance with § 222` IS TRUE
-- Neither.
#ASSERT NOT (`s 312(h) I may call the special meeting of stockholders to elect directors` WITH `I am an officer of the corporation` IS FALSE, `I am a stockholder of the corporation` IS FALSE, `notice is given in accordance with § 222` IS TRUE)
-- No notice under section 222.
#ASSERT NOT (`s 312(h) I may call the special meeting of stockholders to elect directors` WITH `I am an officer of the corporation` IS FALSE, `I am a stockholder of the corporation` IS TRUE, `notice is given in accordance with § 222` IS FALSE)

-- s 312(h) this instrument is our bylaws for the revival
-- A director: the bylaws in force before the void period.
#ASSERT `s 312(h) this instrument is our bylaws for the revival` WITH `the instrument would be the duly adopted bylaws of the corporation but for the certificate of incorporation having become forfeited or void pursuant to this title` IS TRUE
-- Not those bylaws.
#ASSERT NOT (`s 312(h) this instrument is our bylaws for the revival` WITH `the instrument would be the duly adopted bylaws of the corporation but for the certificate of incorporation having become forfeited or void pursuant to this title` IS FALSE)

-- s 312(i) the time our certificate was void counts toward the section 211(c) periods
-- A stock corporation, after the revival.
#ASSERT `s 312(i) the time our certificate was void counts toward the section 211(c) periods` WITH `the kind of corporation` IS `a stock corporation`, `the revival of the certificate of incorporation has been effected` IS TRUE
-- Subsection (i) does not apply to nonstock corporations.
#ASSERT NOT (`s 312(i) the time our certificate was void counts toward the section 211(c) periods` WITH `the kind of corporation` IS `a nonprofit nonstock corporation that is not charitable`, `the revival of the certificate of incorporation has been effected` IS TRUE)
-- Not yet revived.
#ASSERT NOT (`s 312(i) the time our certificate was void counts toward the section 211(c) periods` WITH `the kind of corporation` IS `a stock corporation`, `the revival of the certificate of incorporation has been effected` IS FALSE)

-- s 312(i) the special meeting of stockholders is deemed our annual meeting
-- A stockholder of a stock corporation who elected directors at that meeting.
#ASSERT `s 312(i) the special meeting of stockholders is deemed our annual meeting` WITH `the kind of corporation` IS `a stock corporation`, `the revival of the certificate of incorporation has been effected` IS TRUE, `the special meeting of stockholders was held in accordance with subsection (h)` IS TRUE
-- Not for a nonstock corporation.
#ASSERT NOT (`s 312(i) the special meeting of stockholders is deemed our annual meeting` WITH `the kind of corporation` IS `a nonprofit nonstock corporation that is not charitable`, `the revival of the certificate of incorporation has been effected` IS TRUE, `the special meeting of stockholders was held in accordance with subsection (h)` IS TRUE)
-- The meeting was not held under subsection (h).
#ASSERT NOT (`s 312(i) the special meeting of stockholders is deemed our annual meeting` WITH `the kind of corporation` IS `a stock corporation`, `the revival of the certificate of incorporation has been effected` IS TRUE, `the special meeting of stockholders was held in accordance with subsection (h)` IS FALSE)

-- s 312(j) subsection (i) of section 312 applies to our corporation
-- A stock corporation.
#ASSERT `s 312(j) subsection (i) of section 312 applies to our corporation` WITH `the kind of corporation` IS `a stock corporation`
-- A nonstock corporation.
#ASSERT NOT (`s 312(j) subsection (i) of section 312 applies to our corporation` WITH `the kind of corporation` IS `a nonstock corporation with membership interests`)
-- A charitable nonstock corporation is a nonstock corporation too.
#ASSERT NOT (`s 312(j) subsection (i) of section 312 applies to our corporation` WITH `the kind of corporation` IS `a charitable nonstock corporation`)

-- s 313(a) our exempt corporation is deemed to have filed all its reports and is relieved of the taxes and penalties
-- An officer of an exempt corporation whose certificate went void under section 510.
#ASSERT `s 313(a) our exempt corporation is deemed to have filed all its reports and is relieved of the taxes and penalties` WITH `the corporation is an exempt corporation within the meaning of § 501(b)` IS TRUE, `the certificate has become forfeited pursuant to § 136(b) for failure to obtain a registered agent` IS FALSE, `the certificate has become inoperative and void by operation of § 510 for failure to file the annual franchise tax reports required and to pay the taxes or penalties from which it would have been exempt if the reports had been filed` IS TRUE, `satisfactory proof of its right to be classified as an exempt corporation has been submitted to the Secretary of State` IS TRUE, `a certificate of revival has been filed with the Secretary of State in manner and form as required by § 312` IS TRUE
-- Or whose certificate was forfeited under section 136(b).
#ASSERT `s 313(a) our exempt corporation is deemed to have filed all its reports and is relieved of the taxes and penalties` WITH `the corporation is an exempt corporation within the meaning of § 501(b)` IS TRUE, `the certificate has become forfeited pursuant to § 136(b) for failure to obtain a registered agent` IS TRUE, `the certificate has become inoperative and void by operation of § 510 for failure to file the annual franchise tax reports required and to pay the taxes or penalties from which it would have been exempt if the reports had been filed` IS FALSE, `satisfactory proof of its right to be classified as an exempt corporation has been submitted to the Secretary of State` IS TRUE, `a certificate of revival has been filed with the Secretary of State in manner and form as required by § 312` IS TRUE
-- Forfeited or void for neither reason.
#ASSERT NOT (`s 313(a) our exempt corporation is deemed to have filed all its reports and is relieved of the taxes and penalties` WITH `the corporation is an exempt corporation within the meaning of § 501(b)` IS TRUE, `the certificate has become forfeited pursuant to § 136(b) for failure to obtain a registered agent` IS FALSE, `the certificate has become inoperative and void by operation of § 510 for failure to file the annual franchise tax reports required and to pay the taxes or penalties from which it would have been exempt if the reports had been filed` IS FALSE, `satisfactory proof of its right to be classified as an exempt corporation has been submitted to the Secretary of State` IS TRUE, `a certificate of revival has been filed with the Secretary of State in manner and form as required by § 312` IS TRUE)
-- No proof of exempt status submitted.
#ASSERT NOT (`s 313(a) our exempt corporation is deemed to have filed all its reports and is relieved of the taxes and penalties` WITH `the corporation is an exempt corporation within the meaning of § 501(b)` IS TRUE, `the certificate has become forfeited pursuant to § 136(b) for failure to obtain a registered agent` IS FALSE, `the certificate has become inoperative and void by operation of § 510 for failure to file the annual franchise tax reports required and to pay the taxes or penalties from which it would have been exempt if the reports had been filed` IS TRUE, `satisfactory proof of its right to be classified as an exempt corporation has been submitted to the Secretary of State` IS FALSE, `a certificate of revival has been filed with the Secretary of State in manner and form as required by § 312` IS TRUE)

-- s 313(b) our exempt corporation is revived with the same force and effect
-- All four.
#ASSERT `s 313(b) our exempt corporation is revived with the same force and effect` WITH `the corporation is an exempt corporation within the meaning of § 501(b)` IS TRUE, `the corporation has filed the proof of classification as required by subsection (a)` IS TRUE, `the corporation has filed the certificate of revival` IS TRUE, `the required filing fees have been paid` IS TRUE
-- The filing fees are unpaid.
#ASSERT NOT (`s 313(b) our exempt corporation is revived with the same force and effect` WITH `the corporation is an exempt corporation within the meaning of § 501(b)` IS TRUE, `the corporation has filed the proof of classification as required by subsection (a)` IS TRUE, `the corporation has filed the certificate of revival` IS TRUE, `the required filing fees have been paid` IS FALSE)

-- s 313(c) our exempt corporation must still file the annual report
-- An officer: revival does not excuse the annual report.
#ASSERT `s 313(c) our exempt corporation must still file the annual report` WITH `the corporation is an exempt corporation within the meaning of § 501(b)` IS TRUE
-- Not an exempt corporation: this section says nothing about its report.
#ASSERT NOT (`s 313(c) our exempt corporation must still file the annual report` WITH `the corporation is an exempt corporation within the meaning of § 501(b)` IS FALSE)

-- s 314 our renewed corporation continues as its certificate provides
-- A director: both.
#ASSERT `s 314 our renewed corporation continues as its certificate provides` WITH `the corporation desires to renew, extend and continue its corporate existence` IS TRUE, `the corporation has complied with the applicable constitutional provisions of this State` IS TRUE
-- Constitutional provisions not complied with.
#ASSERT NOT (`s 314 our renewed corporation continues as its certificate provides` WITH `the corporation desires to renew, extend and continue its corporate existence` IS TRUE, `the corporation has complied with the applicable constitutional provisions of this State` IS FALSE)
